  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 20.02,
      "e": 21.69,
      "text": "[SHUMAN] We've been studying fire"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.69,
      "e": 24.36,
      "text": "since before we had electricity,"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.36,
      "e": 26.26,
      "text": "and so we do know a lot about fire."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.26,
      "e": 28.63,
      "text": "There's a lot of long-term knowledge"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.63,
      "e": 31.63,
      "text": "about how fire behaves in a system,"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.73,
      "e": 33.77,
      "text": "how fire is good for systems,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.77,
      "e": 35.94,
      "text": "and why we need fire."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.94,
      "e": 37.94,
      "text": "But there are still fundamental questions"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.94,
      "e": 40.97,
      "text": "about how we can study fire, how"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.97,
      "e": 42.84,
      "text": "we can detect fire,"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.84,
      "e": 45.65,
      "text": "and where we can detect fire."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.65,
      "e": 47.68,
      "text": "There's a real need for,"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.68,
      "e": 50.35,
      "text": "identifying technology that we can use."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.35,
      "e": 52.22,
      "text": "You know, here,"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.22,
      "e": 55.19,
      "text": "on an aircraft or on a sensor as well"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.19,
      "e": 57.46,
      "text": "as, tools and technology"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.46,
      "e": 59.23,
      "text": "that we can use in Earth orbit"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.23,
      "e": 60.83,
      "text": "to help support proactive"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.83,
      "e": 62.3,
      "text": "wildland fire management."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.5,
      "e": 70.7,
      "text": "[SHUMAN] Fire is a natural part"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.7,
      "e": 72.2,
      "text": "of the Earth's system."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.2,
      "e": 74.87,
      "text": "And because fire has been"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.87,
      "e": 75.74,
      "text": "part of the Earth"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.74,
      "e": 77.91,
      "text": "for so many thousands of years,"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.91,
      "e": 80.95,
      "text": "we actually have fire adapted ecosystems."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.95,
      "e": 81.95,
      "text": "And so in areas"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.95,
      "e": 84.75,
      "text": "where you have regular wildfire,"
    },
    {
      "s": 84.75,
      "e": 86.45,
      "text": "you require fire"
    },
