      "e": 103.14,
      "text": "we're partnering with Fort Stewart,"
    },
    {
      "s": 103.14,
      "e": 105.04,
      "text": "which is in Georgia."
    },
    {
      "s": 105.04,
      "e": 107.84,
      "text": "And so an important part of the FireSense"
    },
    {
      "s": 107.84,
      "e": 110.34,
      "text": "campaigns are these partnerships"
    },
    {
      "s": 110.34,
      "e": 112.08,
      "text": "between a number of different types"
    },
    {
      "s": 112.08,
      "e": 115.05,
      "text": "of, agencies and, collaborators."
    },
    {
      "s": 115.25,
      "e": 116.42,
      "text": "[HIERS] Everything we do,"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.42,
      "e": 117.48,
      "text": "you know, on test and training"
    },
    {
      "s": 117.48,
      "e": 120.19,
      "text": "ranges has potential, to start fires"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.96,
      "e": 129.46,
      "text": "and mitigate that wildfire risk."
    },
    {
      "s": 129.46,
      "e": 131.33,
      "text": "We use a lot of prescribed fire, in fact,"
    },
    {
      "s": 131.33,
      "e": 132.23,
      "text": "more than almost"
    },
    {
      "s": 132.23,
      "e": 135.1,
      "text": "any other federal landowner."
    },
    {
      "s": 135.1,
      "e": 136.57,
      "text": "[SEANOR] By keeping these fuel levels"
    },
    {
      "s": 136.57,
      "e": 137.57,
      "text": "so low like this,"
    },
    {
      "s": 137.57,
      "e": 139.0,
      "text": "when we do have wildfires occur,"
    },
    {
      "s": 139.0,
      "e": 140.64,
      "text": "they can be suppressed very easily."
    },
    {
      "s": 140.64,
      "e": 142.11,
      "text": "We don't have to interrupt"
    },
    {
      "s": 142.11,
      "e": 143.48,
      "text": "military training."
    },
    {
      "s": 143.48,
      "e": 144.68,
      "text": "And then also on Fort Stewart,"
    },
    {
      "s": 144.68,
      "e": 145.75,
      "text": "we have, several"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.75,
      "e": 146.95,
      "text": "threatened, endangered species."
    },
    {
      "s": 146.95,
      "e": 149.01,
      "text": "This this whole ecosystem is fire"
