      "text": "the holy grail"
    },
    {
      "s": 188.32,
      "e": 189.69,
      "text": "in fire science for a long time."
    },
    {
      "s": 192.32,
      "e": 193.56,
      "text": "[FURMAN] Let's go ahead and get settled in"
    },
    {
      "s": 193.56,
      "e": 195.76,
      "text": "so we can get started on time."
    },
    {
      "s": 200.43,
      "e": 202.97,
      "text": "[FOWLER] The moving parts have been consistent,"
    },
    {
      "s": 202.97,
      "e": 204.0,
      "text": "and there's quite a bit,"
    },
    {
      "s": 204.0,
      "e": 205.91,
      "text": "and it tends to get complicated"
    },
    {
      "s": 205.91,
      "e": 206.57,
      "text": "in the air space"
    },
    {
      "s": 206.57,
      "e": 207.34,
      "text": "[SEANOR] It's really systematic."
    },
    {
      "s": 207.34,
      "e": 208.74,
      "text": "It starts right at the beginning"
    },
    {
      "s": 208.74,
      "e": 210.58,
      "text": "before we even leave the office."
    },
    {
      "s": 210.58,
      "e": 212.08,
      "text": "Based on that weather forecast"
