      "text": "helicopter that was,"
    },
    {
      "s": 313.35,
      "e": 314.11,
      "text": "burning the unit."
    },
    {
      "s": 314.11,
      "e": 315.21,
      "text": "[SEANOR] There's a machine called a Plastic"
