    },
    {
      "s": 682.58,
      "e": 684.05,
      "text": "And so fire impacts"
    },
    {
      "s": 684.05,
      "e": 685.75,
      "text": "all aspects of the Earth system."
    },
    {
      "s": 685.75,
      "e": 687.75,
      "text": "It's going to impact the soil."
    },
    {
      "s": 687.75,
      "e": 689.72,
      "text": "It's going to impact the vegetation."
    },
    {
      "s": 689.72,
      "e": 691.16,
      "text": "It creates smoke,"
    },
    {
      "s": 691.16,
      "e": 692.96,
      "text": "which is then carried through the air."
    },
    {
      "s": 692.96,
      "e": 694.86,
      "text": "So it impacts our atmosphere."
    },
    {
      "s": 694.86,
      "e": 696.39,
      "text": "The fire behavior itself"
    },
    {
      "s": 696.39,
      "e": 698.2,
      "text": "generates its own weather."
    },
    {
      "s": 698.2,
      "e": 698.76,
      "text": "And so"
    },
    {
      "s": 698.76,
      "e": 699.7,
      "text": "because of all"
    },
    {
      "s": 699.7,
      "e": 700.83,
      "text": "of these different systems,"
    },
    {
      "s": 700.83,
      "e": 701.97,
      "text": "we need"
    },
    {
      "s": 701.97,
      "e": 704.17,
      "text": "different scientists who have expertise"
    },
    {
      "s": 704.17,
      "e": 705.87,
      "text": "in all of these pieces"
    },
    {
      "s": 705.87,
      "e": 709.94,
      "text": "and so on campaigns, we have integrated teams"
    },
    {
      "s": 710.11,
      "e": 712.08,
      "text": "So that we have integrated data."
    },
    {
      "s": 712.08,
      "e": 713.45,
      "text": "[HIERS] Collaboration is built"
    },
    {
      "s": 713.45,
      "e": 714.91,
      "text": "into fire management."
    },
    {
      "s": 714.91,
      "e": 716.58,
      "text": "Whether it's, the initial attack"
    },
    {
      "s": 716.58,
      "e": 718.28,
      "text": "mutual aid response,"
    },
    {
      "s": 718.28,
      "e": 720.02,
      "text": "or research and development,"
    },
    {
      "s": 720.02,
      "e": 721.39,
      "text": "we all bring certain"
    },
    {
      "s": 721.39,
      "e": 723.52,
      "text": "perspectives, tools, technology"
    },
    {
      "s": 723.52,
      "e": 724.36,
      "text": "to research"
    },
    {
      "s": 724.36,
      "e": 725.69,
      "text": "and in this case to be able"
    },
    {
      "s": 725.69,
      "e": 726.79,
      "text": "to deploy them together"
    },
    {
      "s": 726.79,
      "e": 727.89,
      "text": "gives us synergies"
    },
    {
      "s": 727.89,
      "e": 729.43,
      "text": "that just would not be possible"
    },
    {
      "s": 729.43,
      "e": 730.26,
      "text": "if we go it alone."
    },
    {
      "s": 730.26,
      "e": 731.7,
      "text": "[SHUMAN] The way that FireSense will be"
    },
    {
      "s": 731.7,
      "e": 733.37,
      "text": "successful is by working"
    },
    {
      "s": 733.37,
      "e": 735.5,
      "text": "directly with local partners"
    },
    {
      "s": 735.5,
      "e": 737.47,
      "text": "so that we can support decision"
    },
    {
      "s": 737.47,
      "e": 739.4,
      "text": "making that they're doing on the ground."
    },
    {
      "s": 739.4,
      "e": 740.0,
      "text": "[ANDERSON] In other words,"
    },
    {
      "s": 740.0,
      "e": 741.47,
      "text": "this helps us flatten out"
    },
    {
      "s": 741.47,
